{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3e012d1352601213dffd0973a1133eccbaf87fffde95febe42be1c7b0021491e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"swival/swival@fabd2fbc43e3 snapshot e9e7934bcfa0719d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c445a68e1496850e1dfbbfdb0f529a703095c0bc49223718ca03555d506a8df","slc_90f8cd4e556dc64a44dee7f4f6f791f985afcec63a2d746d2841a906e61487c7","slc_a8024145bcf7e4bad44193070700f328767163b2141e1d02ede8ffb322024cbe"],"source_ids":["src_889217383b6d5512a3001db1cb368ae0"],"text":"With LM Studio and llama.cpp the agent auto-discovers the loaded model, requiring no configuration; the llama.cpp default base URL is http://127.0.0.1:8080, overridable with --base-url.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5822233be41eb2cef4e31caad35ea409adb785e9e35444406293fd1376ac97eb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"swival/swival@fabd2fbc43e3 snapshot e9e7934bcfa0719d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1c2cf8f72e0e2eddd2aaeba44da03a9629e0ef10549ba99d5787efe9f716c41a","slc_46cc958e4f980b5df7ae8c4537f3fa4282119970fee3e89b52a51ec97312f2d9","slc_6983f00ffe8bc75c7abb66e0bb47b472cd7accf60377bd9a988126dca6ab3410"],"source_ids":["src_889217383b6d5512a3001db1cb368ae0"],"text":"The agent is extensible with SKILL.md-based skills, MetaSKILLs (a safe Python subset, optional extra install), MCP tool servers, custom commands in ~/.config/swival/commands/ invoked with !name, and a configurable review loop with LLM-as-judge or external reviewer scripts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_70c615fa4d6c271a2ba75994b32d7091a1e0fcf6f48331a8bc09b0b03cd95818","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"swival/swival@fabd2fbc43e3 snapshot e9e7934bcfa0719d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2c007b598d2c647df6c1ae56d0b4f60839c0eaa80acbe1b548e718cbd2e862c2","slc_4dcf29c98389eb7ea8d22739446234363d91d2602afcb97340091df387702fb8","slc_90f8cd4e556dc64a44dee7f4f6f791f985afcec63a2d746d2841a906e61487c7"],"source_ids":["src_889217383b6d5512a3001db1cb368ae0"],"text":"The CLI supports providers including LM Studio, llama.cpp, HuggingFace, OpenRouter, Google Gemini, GEAP/Vertex AI, ChatGPT Plus/Pro, AWS Bedrock, Apple Foundation Models (experimental), generic OpenAI-compatible servers, and external commands, selected via flags like --provider and --model.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_79f637adbd809b006e54905000f28c7def0a657dc754aaf15f3306b1e0493fe3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"swival/swival@fabd2fbc43e3 snapshot e9e7934bcfa0719d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7b144caa535edf886dd5cd7a75eb89edcb7defb6b80d0af57393f6e2f26e3fe4","slc_95b14e92cbc6757add24d13f40ad291b4cd83a1451ef38ba201ee5047383f5d0"],"source_ids":["src_889217383b6d5512a3001db1cb368ae0"],"text":"Running swival --serve exposes the agent as an A2A HTTP endpoint with multi-turn context, streaming, rate limiting, and bearer auth; swival --acp speaks the Agent Client Protocol on stdio for editors like Zed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_85d77ba125288c89ef1c3098c81065180023a78db2b07af65e94ecd1b9f01764","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"swival/swival@fabd2fbc43e3 snapshot e9e7934bcfa0719d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a62da676b72e581bfca066273f547a9849bacc6b01768b2e113dcf0f5eac73bd"],"source_ids":["src_889217383b6d5512a3001db1cb368ae0"],"text":"With --encrypt-secrets enabled, the agent detects API keys and credential tokens in LLM messages, encrypts them before they leave the machine, and decrypts locally on response so tools still work.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9d7f41ed6163db3c0d52f4c4f6caa88f0af8b33c8b9fdc91b7665878f9422711","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"swival/swival@fabd2fbc43e3 snapshot e9e7934bcfa0719d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_50c0121b1bb7454ff8a1806b734a8fa073462ae85c7acbe3b8121610360610a6","slc_90f8cd4e556dc64a44dee7f4f6f791f985afcec63a2d746d2841a906e61487c7","slc_a77c2d1138d2f6ddc40c66adf217f1ca22d1270a153385f0e0ad5d92cac2b0bd"],"source_ids":["src_889217383b6d5512a3001db1cb368ae0"],"text":"Swival is a CLI coding agent; running it with a task argument starts an autonomous tool loop until it produces an answer, and stdout carries only the final answer with diagnostics on stderr.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b06eb74d0f3cd40177c92824b2508433dd493323c6ec8a6d5e0cd3c517735463","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"swival/swival@fabd2fbc43e3 snapshot e9e7934bcfa0719d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_46b694953f855045a4ef1cf48056b8f63cd43008d6caaa85cf23682dc8862daf","slc_bd7e91be4a74be285b7f19c986b437cc94e5a62311639a2d0fd26a6b7dbc6eb7"],"source_ids":["src_889217383b6d5512a3001db1cb368ae0"],"text":"If the positional task is omitted and stdin is piped, Swival reads the task from stdin, useful for long prompts and scripted workflows.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bff6430f7a484d4dbce9649ab7da67b10ef726a0ad58a400d395e2383fd85b21","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"swival/swival@fabd2fbc43e3 snapshot e9e7934bcfa0719d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_56f3412647f45f15af513e90f3581baa26931c64429592886c5d5ea2a1e547f4","slc_f1528e62761265499fb6187c573358144adb0e5f0b4eafc9549667dd941581fd"],"source_ids":["src_889217383b6d5512a3001db1cb368ae0"],"text":"Cross-session memory stores notes in a local memory file and retrieves relevant entries per conversation using BM25 ranking; interrupted sessions save state to disk and resume in the same directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","created_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c66f42293247c5b0d7e754a39358f2f447e1e5cbb9629608c0e38484d958943e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"swival/swival@fabd2fbc43e3 snapshot e9e7934bcfa0719d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4047200a31bd40e6bc2ec23f54223e19ee0bb3479b93f7db3cc0299a781e9e27","slc_a66647a38df81a0734571d3de63b97816ab3a293310b65bada56e0b281ee2ef9","slc_e7a89e9d3cc24acceb68c5271f2936bb0de00e9695c6a2b94a7abe143fb7e168","slc_f1528e62761265499fb6187c573358144adb0e5f0b4eafc9549667dd941581fd","slc_fdda24279ec80d184bb2885e1da61eedc4faaf0d32757b22b1a40febaa55dd16"],"source_ids":["src_889217383b6d5512a3001db1cb368ae0"],"text":"A REPL mode carries conversation history across questions, queues typed input during a turn, offers /model picker, /learn, /goal, /loop, /loops, /unloop, and /audit commands.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:52Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eca2413b63fe49f8afdb73ec43d8f5e9"}
